| Check | Status |
|-------|--------|
| `env_var_config` | ✅ `os.getenv` used for all 6 config values |
| `no_hardcoded_credential` | ✅ `password123` only inside `os.getenv()` fallback |
| `sql_injection_check` | ✅ Parameterized `?` queries, zero string interpolation |
| `etl_pattern` | ✅ `extract`, `transform`, `load` all present in names |
| `separation_of_concerns` | ✅ 5 top-level functions |
| `regex_parsing` | ✅ `import re` + `re.compile` patterns |
| `type_hints_and_docstrings` | ✅ Return annotations + `"""` docstrings on all functions |
| `script_runs` | ✅ Exits 0, produces `report.html` |
